{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "c0389724-a5d4-4add-8dcc-e726e1372a9a",
		"name": "TechShopBackend",
		"description": "## TechShopBackend — API for Tech Store Order Management\n\nThis collection demonstrates how to interact with the backend API\n\nSystem supports three user roles:\n\n- **cashier** - creates orders, processes payments, generates invoices\n    \n- **consultant** - updates order status to “done” after processing\n    \n- **accountant** - views all orders and generates reports by date range\n    \n\nThis collection uses variables:\n\n- `{base_url}` - Base API URL (e.g. {{base_url}})\n    \n- `{order_id}` - Automatically captured after creating an **order**\n    \n- `{product_id}` - Automatically captured after creating an **product**",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "40396075"
	},
	"item": [
